[0m[49m[39m  49, 49[0m:[39m[49m `strcmp`, `printf`, `sprintf`, `__assert_fail`, `abort`, plus the
[0m[49m[39m  50, 50[0m:[39m[49m `_Unwind_*` / `__cxa_*` / `pthread_*` runtime support that `libstd` pulls in).
[0m[49m[38;5;9m- 51    [0m:[38;5;9m[49m **0 missing / undefined non-libc symbols.**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **0 missing / undefined non-libc symbols.**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     53[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `tests/symbols.rs` enforces both halves of this automatically:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `defined_symbol_diff_is_empty` — `nm -D --defined-only` on both objects, then
